  "overview": "This page stores NPGC facilities information for Facilities Hostel Girls. Captured source headings include: Facilities, Hostel Facilities, Facilities, About. Source page: https://www.npgc.in/Facilities-HostelGirls.aspx",
  "content": "Sports & Games\nMagazines & Publications\nHostel Facilities\nNCC, NSS & Scouts and Guides\nMedical Facilities\nInfrastructure\nUnit for Differently Abled\nHostel Facilities\nA number of students from other cities and states are studying in the college. To provide accommodation to both boys and girls, the college is providing accommodation facility. There is a hostel for the girls with a capacity of 155 girls and there is also hostel for the boys with a capacity of 100 boys.\nThe hostels of the college are properly managed without any problem of discipline.\nFacilities\nInternet access\nAir-conditioned Rooms\nGenerator Sets\nPhotocopier machine\nWater cooler with purifier\nGeysers\nMeditation rooms\nCultural hall\nCommon reading area\nCommon rooms with televisions having DTH\nGymnasium\nYoga Center\nBadminton court\nIndoor games\nMess\nCCTV for security\nMedical facilities\nFurnished guest house for the parents of inmates",
